      "created_at": "2024-11-08T07:32:00.495Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey ERPNext Community! <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/tada.png?v=15\" title=\":tada:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":tada:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>We’re thrilled to announce that we’ve successfully integrated <strong>Digimiles SMS APIs</strong> with ERPNext, and it’s been delivering exceptional performance for our clients over the past 3+ months! <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/chart_increasing.png?v=15\" title=\":chart_increasing:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":chart_increasing:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> This integration has been a game-changer, especially for boosting <strong>Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)</strong> security. <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/locked_with_key.png?v=15\" title=\":locked_with_key:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":locked_with_key:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-444930-key-features-of-the-integration-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-444930-key-features-of-the-integration-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/glowing_star.png?v=15\" title=\":glowing_star:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":glowing_star:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Key Features of the Integration:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2FA with OTP</strong>: Add an extra layer of security to your ERPNext login.</li>\n<li><strong>Automated Alerts</strong>: Instant SMS notifications for invoices, payments, and other transactions.</li>\n<li><strong>Customizable Messaging</strong>: Tailor your SMS templates for specific workflows.</li>\n<li><strong>High Delivery Rate</strong>: Reliable and fast SMS delivery, ensuring important messages reach your users on time.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We’re here to help you enhance your ERPNext experience with this powerful SMS integration! <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/mobile_phone_with_arrow.png?v=15\" title=\":mobile_phone_with_arrow:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":mobile_phone_with_arrow:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>If you’re interested in setting this up for your ERPNext system, feel free to reach out to us at <strong>obaid@easycloud.in</strong>. Let’s secure and streamline your operations together! <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/flexed_biceps.png?v=15\" title=\":flexed_biceps:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":flexed_biceps:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Looking forward to supporting your 2FA and communication needs! <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/rocket.png?v=15\" title=\":rocket:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rocket:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
